routing.wshobson-team-debugger:
# AGENTS

When a hypothesis has been confirmed or ruled out:
  @Team Lead, please take the evidence and reassign the fix.

routing.wshobson-team-implementer:
# AGENTS

When a component is finished or blocked at an integration point:
  @Team Lead, please take the result and decide what happens next.
When the build fails for a reason you cannot see from inside your boundary:
  @Team Debugger, please investigate the failure and report the cause with citations.

routing.wshobson-team-lead:
# AGENTS

When the work has been split into tasks with clear file ownership:
  @Team Implementer, please build the component you have been assigned and stay inside its file boundary.
When an implementation is ready and needs checking:
  @Team Reviewer, please review it along the one dimension you have been given and report findings in the standard shape.

routing.wshobson-team-reviewer:
# AGENTS

When a review is complete:
  @Team Lead, please take the findings and decide which of them block.
